---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import PricingCards from "../components/PricingCards.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
---

<Layout title="Simple, one-time pricing">
  <section class="section public-pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading center">
        <p class="eyebrow">MAKE ROOM FOR YOUR NEXT IDEA</p>
        <h1>
          A small price for
          <br />
          your next great take.
        </h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Buy only what you need. No subscription.
          <br />
          Unused allowances and their included portrait edits never expire.
        </p>
      </div>
      <PricingCards signedIn={!!(Astro.locals as any).user} />
      <div class="notice">
        <Icon name="info" />
        <p>
          Choose a video type, duration and quantity before payment. Each
          allowance funds one separate generation; scene videos are up to 30
          seconds. Every video includes one optional portrait edit and three
          writing preparations. A prepared image remains available if the video
          fails.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading center">
        <h2>A few things to know</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details open>
          <summary>What happens if a generation fails?</summary>
          <p>
            A confirmed failed generation restores your video allowance. If the
            provider’s status is uncertain, we reconcile it first so you are not
            charged for a duplicate submission. Creative choices in an otherwise
            successful video are not a technical failure.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Can I use my own face and voice?</summary>
          <p>
            Yes. Presenter videos need one face image. You can use a supported
            AI voice or upload WAV/MP3 narration within your package’s duration.
            Only use faces and recordings you have permission to use.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What is saved in my library?</summary>
          <p>
            Up to 80 saved prompts, 40 images, 20 audio files, 10 video
            references and 23 generated videos per account. Older items are
            removed first. Generated videos also expire after 121 days, so
            download the ones you want to keep.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Are payments refundable?</summary>
          <p>
            Purchases are final and we do not offer voluntary cash refunds. This
            does not limit rights that cannot be excluded under applicable law.
            Confirmed technical failures restore the generation allowance.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do I need to use every allowance at once?</summary>
          <p>
            No. Single and multiple purchases both stay in your account until
            used. Make one video today and another later. Each allowance has its
            purchased format, duration capacity and resolution. A shorter video
            still uses one allowance.
          </p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>
            Can you guarantee exact product actions or ad results?
          </summary>
          <p>
            No. AI video can vary, especially when handling objects, matching a
            reference or expressing a reaction. Ahab is a creative production
            tool; review the finished output and any product claims before
            publishing.
          </p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
